# Krimble 2026-11-15: the scheme "Krimble Dark Gray" (George: "We should create a simplified dark gray theme with no bevels. Modern pro style." and "No selection blue either."): the Blue-Gray palette with every low-saturation color and every blue or cyan turned to the gray of the same brightness; red, green and orange accents are kept.
